---
import Card from "@/components/Card.astro";
import LogoCarousel from "@/components/LogoCarousel.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about-us" class="py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p class="type-label text-suzaku-green/80 mb-4">About us</p>
    <h2 class="type-heading mb-4">
      4 years of L1 blockchains expertise
    </h2>
    <p class="type-subheading text-white/40 mb-8">
      We've been building tooling for L1 blockchains since 2021.<br />
      We know what breaks. We build to prevent it.
    </p>

    <!-- Expertise -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10">
      <Card>
        <div class="type-card-title text-suzaku-green mb-3">Deep operator experience</div>
        <p class="type-card-body text-white/50">
          Running validators across multiple networks taught us the struggles of decentralization.
          We know where to focus our efforts to make it work.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card>
        <div class="type-card-title text-suzaku-green mb-3">Co-authors of ACP-99</div>
        <p class="type-card-body text-white/50">
          ACP-99, written with Ava Labs, is the Avalanche standard for
          L1 validator set management. Our BalancerValidatorManager is built
          directly on this foundation.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card>
        <div class="type-card-title text-suzaku-green mb-3">Open-source infrastructure</div>
        <p class="type-card-body text-white/50">
          We built Ash, an open-source toolkit for L1 operations, and are maintaining Ash Wallet, the multisig infrastructure for Avalanche L1s.        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <!-- Partners & Backers carousel -->
    <p class="type-label text-white/50 mb-4">Partners &amp; backers</p>
    <LogoCarousel />
  </div>
</Section>
